```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "attach a pet name to a subject in a named sensorium"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///sense.petname.attaches", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/sense.petname.attaches"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/sense.petname.attaches"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.petname.attaches ~ a subject takes a pet name

`lares sensorium name <sensorium> <subject> <label…>` attaches a pet name to one subject in a named sensorium standing on this house.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ name

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`name` params=`sensorium/memory subject/e-12 label/[[the harbor]] ~ name a subject`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ sensorium · subject · label

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`sensorium` params=`takes/name needs/required seat/1 as/<sensorium> ~ a named sensorium standing on this house`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`subject` params=`takes/id needs/required seat/2 as/<subject> ~ the subject named`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`label` params=`takes/words needs/required seat/3 as/<label…> ~ the pet name`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ works this host's scratch sensoria under the cache; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[sense.petname.attaches sensorium/memory subject/e-12 label/harbor]] ~ name a standing sensorium, a subject and a label`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ named

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`named` params=`exit/0 ~ the entry attached`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares sensorium name

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares sensorium name]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

